  "title": "Vegan Gnocchi with Pesto, Spinach, and Cannellini Beans",
  "description": "This gnocchi pasta dish is full of creamy white beans, mushrooms, spinach, and a cheese-free pesto, making it a delicious vegan meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Connie Fabian Byrnes"
  ],
